[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u4EE5\u4E0A\u304C\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u306B\u95A2\u3059\u308B\u5831\u544A\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u597D\u5947\u5FC3\u304C\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u5F37\u3044\u306E\u306F\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u304C\u3001\n\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u308A\u60AA\u3044\u5974\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3055\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...That concludes my report on Walther. His intense curiosity is concerning, but he seems less troublesome than initially thought."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u304B\u3001\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u5F15\u304D\u7D9A\u304D\u3001\u8B66\u6212\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. Please continue keeping an eye on him."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3068\u2026\u2026\u65E5\u9803\u306E\u76E3\u8996\u5F79\u3001\u611F\u8B1D\u3059\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And... thank you for your daily surveillance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3084\u3001\u3053\u308C\u306F\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my, if it isn\u0027t Sir Logy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u304B\u3002\u5947\u9047\u3060\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther. What a coincidence."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u738B\u5BAE\u306B\u3054\u7528\u4E8B\u304C\uFF1F\n\u4ECA\u65E5\u306E\u76E3\u8996\u5F79\u306F\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3067\u306F\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u306F\u305A\n\u3067\u3059\u304C\u2026\u2026\u3044\u3084",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Business at the palace? I don\u0027t believe you\u0027re on surveillance duty today... Ah."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3001\u79C1\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9\u6BBF\u306B\n\u5831\u544A\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306E\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see, you were reporting about me to Sir Brad."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3088\u304F\u5206\u304B\u3063\u305F\u306A\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(How did he figure that out...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u7A81\u7136\u3053\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u8CEA\u554F\u3092\u3057\u3066\n\u6050\u7E2E\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Pardon my sudden question, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u306F\u79C1\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\n\u3069\u3046\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What do you think of me, Sir Logy?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u524D\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What I think of you...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3069\u3046\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u304B\u3001\u304B\u3002\n\u3000\u6B63\u76F4\u306A\u3068\u3053\u308D\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(What do I think... To be honest...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u3053\u3057\u3070\u3089\u304F\u884C\u52D5\u3092\u5171\u306B\u3057\u3066\u304D\u3066\u3001\n\u3000\u6700\u521D\u306E\u5370\u8C61\u304B\u3089\u3060\u3044\u3076\u5909\u308F\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u3000\u305D\u308C\u3092\u6B63\u76F4\u306B\u8A00\u3048\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3060\u308D\u3046\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(After spending time with him lately, my impression has changed quite a bit from the start. I should just be honest.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5143\u932C\u91D1\u515A\u306E\u8981\u6CE8\u610F\u4EBA\u7269",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A person of interest from the former Alchemy Faction"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5143\u932C\u91D1\u515A\u306E\u8981\u6CE8\u610F\u4EBA\u7269\u3068\u3044\u3046\u8A8D\u8B58\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see you as a person of interest from the former Alchemy Faction."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u624B\u53B3\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u4E8B\u5B9F\u3067\u3059\u3002\u53D7\u3051\u5165\u308C\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Harsh, but fair. It\u0027s the truth. I\u0027ll accept that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u306F\u308A\u4E00\u5EA6\u72AF\u3057\u305F\u7F6A\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3082\u306E\u3092\n\u62ED\u3046\u306E\u306F\u5927\u5909\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\u305D\u308C\u3092\u7406\u89E3\u3057\u305F\u4E0A\u3067\n\u72AF\u7F6A\u306B\u624B\u3092\u67D3\u3081\u305F\u306F\u305A\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed, it\u0027s difficult to erase past sins. I knew that when I chose to commit those crimes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F8C\u6094\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3001\n\u305D\u306E\u6642\u306E\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u304B\u3089\u306F\u5909\u308F\u3063\u305F\u3068\u3044\u3046\n\u3053\u3068\u3060\u308D\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The fact that you regret it means you\u0027ve changed from who you were then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\n\u9762\u767D\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3001\u4EBA\u306E\u5909\u5316\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3082\u306E\u306F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. Human change is quite fascinating, isn\u0027t it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u77E5\u8B58\u306E\u63A2\u6C42\u306B\u4E00\u751F\u61F8\u547D\u306A\u7537",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A man devoted to pursuing knowledge"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u77E5\u8B58\u306E\u63A2\u6C42\u306B\u4E00\u751F\u61F8\u547D\u306A\u7537\u3068\u3044\u3046\u8A8D\u8B58\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see you as a man devoted to pursuing knowledge."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u304A\u3002\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306E\u65B9\u306B\n\u305D\u3046\u8A55\u4FA1\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3051\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u5149\u6804\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my! I\u0027m honored to receive such an evaluation from a foreign alchemist."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u3072\u305F\u3080\u304D\u306A\u59FF\u52E2\u304C\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u3089\u3057\u3055\u3067\u3082\n\u3042\u308A\u3001\u9577\u6240\u3067\u3082\u3042\u308B\u3002\n\u77ED\u6240\u3068\u3082\u306A\u308A\u3048\u308B\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That earnest dedication is both your defining trait and your strength. Though it could also be a weakness..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3002\u305D\u308C\u306F\u91CD\u3005\u627F\u77E5\u3057\u3066\u304A\u308A\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I\u0027m well aware of that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E2\u30CE\u30AF\u30EB\u7537",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The monocle guy"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u2026\u2026\u30E2\u30CE\u30AF\u30EB\u7537\u2026\u2026\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... the monocle guy... really?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3080\u3002\u305D\u308C\u3082\u4E8B\u5B9F\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\n\u3053\u3053\u307E\u3067\u6642\u9593\u3092\u5171\u306B\u3057\u3066\u304D\u3066\u306E\u5370\u8C61\u304C\n\u88C5\u98FE\u54C1\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\u5BC2\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. While that\u0027s technically true, it\u0027s rather disappointing that after all our time together, you focus on my accessories."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u60AA\u3044\u3001\u601D\u3063\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8A00\u8449\u306B\u3059\u308B\u306E\u304C\n\u5F97\u610F\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Sorry, I\u0027m not very good at putting my thoughts into words."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\u6025\u306B\u3069\u3046\u3057\u305F\u3093\u3060\uFF1F\n\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u5370\u8C61\u306A\u3093\u304B\u805E\u3044\u3066\u304D\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But why ask this so suddenly? Why care about my impression of you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3048\u3002\u79C1\u306F\u3088\u304F\u5909\u4EBA\u306A\u3069\u3068\u8A00\u308F\u308C\u3066\u3044\u305F\n\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I\u0027ve often been called eccentric."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3092\u76E3\u8996\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u304B\u3089\n\u3069\u3046\u898B\u3048\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B\u3001\u5C11\u3057\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was curious how I appeared to you, Sir Logy, as my observer."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u3067\u3082\u3001\u4EBA\u306E\u8A55\u4FA1\u3092\u6C17\u306B\u3059\u308B\u3093\u3060\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So even you care about others\u0027 opinions."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u306B\u305B\u3053\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u8EAB\u5206\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\u306D\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3001\u79C1\u306B\u3082\u4E0D\u5B89\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u81EA\u3089\u306B\u8AB2\u3057\u305F\u898F\u5F8B\u304C\u6B63\u3057\u3044\u306E\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, given my position... Besides, I have my own uncertainties. Whether the discipline I\u0027ve imposed on myself is correct."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u898F\u5F8B\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Discipline...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7814\u7A76\u8005\u306E\u591A\u304F\u306F\u3001\u793E\u4F1A\u6027\u306A\u3069\u304C\u7834\u7DBB\u3057\u3066\n\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u79C1\u306E\u4E21\u89AA\u3082\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Many researchers lack social awareness. My parents were like that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u5206\u3001\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u4E2D\u3067\u306E\u898F\u5F8B\u306F\u3057\u3063\u304B\u308A\n\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3002\u79C1\u3082\u4EBA\u306E\u9053\u3060\u3051\u306F\u5916\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306B\n\u5FC3\u639B\u3051\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3064\u3082\u308A\u306A\u306E\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But they maintained strict internal discipline. I too try to ensure I don\u0027t stray from the path of humanity."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Can we trust that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060\u306A\u3002\n\u305D\u306E\u898F\u5F8B\u3092\u5B88\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Can we trust that? That you\u0027ll maintain that discipline?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3002\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u306B\u8A93\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I swear it on alchemy itself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306A\u3089\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3002\u5C11\u306A\u304F\u3068\u3082\n\u4ECA\u306E\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u304C\u9593\u9055\u3063\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3092\n\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3068\u306F\u601D\u3048\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s good enough then. At least, I don\u0027t think the current you is doing anything wrong."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u306F\u3001\u79C1\u3092\u72AF\u7F6A\u8005\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3067\u306F\u306A\u304F\n\u4E00\u4EBA\u306E\u4EBA\u9593\u3068\u3057\u3066\u898B\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...So you see me as a person, not just a criminal, Sir Logy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E21\u89AA\u3082\u7814\u7A76\u8005\u306A\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your parents were researchers too?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E21\u89AA\u3082\u7814\u7A76\u8005\u306A\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your parents were researchers too?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u304C\u2026\u2026\u8208\u5473\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306E\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\n\u8A00\u8449\u306E\u901A\u308A\u3067\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u8A9E\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3082\n\u7279\u306B\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, they were... Are you interested? Though as I said, there\u0027s nothing particularly special to tell."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3063\u3068\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u77E5\u308C\u305F\u3089\u3068\n\u601D\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u304C\u2026\u2026\u6C17\u306B\u969C\u3063\u305F\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I just thought I\u0027d like to know more about you... Did I offend you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3048\u3002\u610F\u56F3\u306F\u5206\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u3001\n\u79C1\u304C\u8A71\u3057\u305F\u304B\u3063\u305F\u306E\u306F\u305D\u3053\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044\u306E\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No. I understand your intention, but that wasn\u0027t what I wanted to discuss."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3046\u306F\u601D\u3048\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I don\u0027t believe that"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u305D\u3046\u306F\u601D\u3048\u306A\u3044\u306A\u3002\n\u898F\u5F8B\u3092\u5B88\u308C\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u76E3\u8996\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I don\u0027t believe that. Isn\u0027t the reason you\u0027re under surveillance because you can\u0027t maintain discipline?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3001\u79C1\u306E\u4E2D\u306E\u898F\u5F8B\u3068\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u305F\u3061\u306E\n\u898F\u5F8B\u306F\u9055\u3044\u307E\u3059\u304B\u3089\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, my internal discipline differs from what you all expect."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u5F8C\u3001\u7814\u7A76\u3092\u7D9A\u3051\u3066\u3044\u304F\u305F\u3081\u306B\u306F\n\u305D\u3053\u3092\u6539\u3081\u3066\u3044\u304B\u306D\u3070\u306A\u3089\u306A\u3044\u306E\u306F\n\u7406\u89E3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3064\u3082\u308A\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand that I need to adjust that to continue my research in the future."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u306F\u305D\u306E\u30BA\u30EC\u3082\u6539\u3081\u305F\u3064\u3082\u308A\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I believe I\u0027ve corrected that discrepancy now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u306B\u304B\u304F\u4F1D\u3048\u305F\u3044\u306E\u306F\u2026\u2026\n\u79C1\u306F\u7814\u7A76\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u7D20\u6750\u3092\u72EC\u5360\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\n\u7814\u7A76\u306E\u904E\u7A0B\u3067\u4EBA\u3092\u6BBA\u3081\u308B\u6240\u307E\u3067\u306F\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What I want to convey is... While I might monopolize materials for research, I won\u0027t go as far as taking lives in the process."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3001\u5FC3\u306B\u6C7A\u3081\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s what I\u0027ve decided in my heart."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3092\u8003\u3048\u308B\u306E\u3082\u91CD\u8981\u3060\u308D\u3046\n\u305F\u3068\u3048\u3070\u4EBA\u9020\u9802\u7363\u306F\u3001\u3069\u3046\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3002\n\u5927\u91CF\u7834\u58CA\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u8D77\u3053\u3057\u3066\u3044\u305F\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s important to consider. For example, what about the synthetic Apex Beasts? They could have caused mass destruction."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F7F\u3046\u4EBA\u6B21\u7B2C\u3067\u3059\u3088\u3002\u30D5\u30E9\u30E0\u3092\n\u571F\u6728\u5DE5\u4E8B\u306B\u4F7F\u3046\u304B\u3001\u751F\u547D\u306B\u6295\u3052\u3064\u3051\u308B\u304B\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u3068\u540C\u3058\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It depends on the user. Like Flame - you can use it for construction or throw it at living beings. It\u0027s the same principle."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D50\u679C\u7684\u306B\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u304C\u4F7F\u3044\u65B9\u3092\n\u6A21\u7D22\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u304C\u3001\n\u5F53\u521D\u306F\u660E\u3089\u304B\u306B\u7834\u58CA\u76EE\u7684\u3060\u3063\u305F\u308D\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While Resna is now exploring proper uses, the original purpose was clearly destructive."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306E\u4E2D\u3067\u306F\u3001\u305D\u3053\u306F\u554F\u984C\u306E\u7121\u3044\u7DDA\u5F15\u304D\u3067\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In my mind, that was within acceptable boundaries."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u2026\u2026\u4FFA\u306F\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3002\u904E\u304E\u305F\u529B\u304C\n\u3000\u4E16\u754C\u306B\u3069\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u5F71\u97FF\u3092\u4E0E\u3048\u308B\u304B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I know what excessive power can do to the world...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u7814\u7A76\u8005\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306E\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3082\u5206\u304B\u308B\u3002\n\u3000\u4FFA\u3060\u3063\u3066\u5143\u306F\u4E00\u4ECB\u306E\u7814\u7A76\u8005\n\u3000\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I understand the researcher\u0027s mindset. I was once just a researcher myself.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3053\u305D\u3002\n\u3000\u7814\u7A76\u8005\u306F\u5DF1\u3092\u5F8B\u3057\u7D9A\u3051\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\n\u3000\u306A\u3089\u306A\u3044\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But that\u0027s exactly why researchers must maintain self-discipline.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u81EA\u5206\u306B\u53B3\u3057\u304F\u306A\u308C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Be stricter with yourself"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u524D\u306E\u4E2D\u306E\u898F\u5F8B\u3002\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u306F\u3001\n\u3082\u3046\u5C11\u3057\u3060\u3051\u53B3\u3057\u304F\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u306A\u3044\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your internal discipline. Could you make it a bit stricter from now on?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8ABF\u5408\u524D\u306B\u3001\u4E00\u5EA6\u3001\u8ABF\u5408\u3059\u308B\u3082\u306E\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\n\u3088\u304F\u8003\u3048\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u3002\u305D\u308C\u304C\u3001\u4E16\u754C\u306B\u2026\u2026\n\u4EBA\u306B\u3069\u3093\u306A\u5F71\u97FF\u3092\u4E0E\u3048\u308B\u304B\u3092",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Before synthesis, please carefully consider what you\u0027re creating. Think about how it might affect the world... and people."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8003\u3048\u304C\u4E0D\u8DB3\u3057\u305F\u7D50\u679C\u8A2A\u308C\u305F\u672A\u6765\u304C\u3001\n\u4FFA\u305F\u3061\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u306A\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our world is the result of insufficient consideration of consequences."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\uFF01\u3000\u201C\u9EC4\u660F\u201D\u3067\u3059\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! You mean the \u0027Twilight\u0027?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3093\u306A\u5F71\u97FF\u304C\u3042\u3063\u305F\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\u7406\u3092\u63A2\u6C42\u3057\u3066\n\u8986\u305B\u3070\u3044\u3044\u3002\u305D\u3046\u601D\u3063\u3066\u304A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I believed that regardless of the impact, we could overturn it by pursuing truth. But..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306F\u79C1\u306E\u9A55\u308A\u3060\u3063\u305F\u306E\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perhaps that was my own arrogance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E8C\u5EA6\u3068\u5371\u967A\u306A\u3082\u306E\u306F\u8ABF\u5408\u3059\u308B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Never synthesize dangerous items again"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E8C\u5EA6\u3068\u5371\u967A\u306A\u3082\u306E\u306F\u8ABF\u5408\u3059\u308B\u306A\u3002\n\u7686\u304C\u7686\u3001\u6B63\u3057\u3044\u4F7F\u3044\u65B9\u304C\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3068\u306F\u9650\u3089\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Never synthesize dangerous items again. Not everyone will use them properly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u306E\u4EF0\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3082\n\u5206\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u305D\u308C\u304C\u4EBA\u3005\u306E\n\u5E0C\u671B\u3068\u306A\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3042\u308B\u306F\u305A\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I understand what you\u0027re saying, Sir Logy. However, these things could also become people\u0027s hope."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u82BD\u304C\u6F70\u3048\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3046\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you stamp out that potential?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5371\u967A\u3092\u5192\u3057\u3066\u307E\u3067\u3084\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s not worth the risk."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7814\u7A76\u306B\u3042\u308B\u7A0B\u5EA6\u306E\u5371\u967A\u306F\u4ED8\u304D\u7269\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u305D\u3053\u306F\u76F8\u5BB9\u308C\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Research always carries some risk. Perhaps we\u0027ll never see eye to eye on this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u5F8C\u306E\u8ABF\u5408\u54C1\u306F\u4FFA\u304C\u3059\u3079\u3066\u76E3\u7763\u3059\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll supervise all your future syntheses"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u5F8C\u306E\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u304C\u8ABF\u5408\u3059\u308B\u3082\u306E\u306F\n\u4FFA\u304C\u3059\u3079\u3066\u76E3\u7763\u3059\u308B\u3002\n\u305D\u3046\u3059\u308C\u3070\u9593\u9055\u3044\u306F\u8D77\u304D\u306A\u3044\u306F\u305A\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll supervise everything you synthesize from now on. That should prevent any mistakes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306E\u8ABF\u5408\u54C1\u306B\u3064\u3044\u3066\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u304B\u3089\n\u610F\u898B\u3092\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3051\u308B\u306E\u306F\u975E\u5E38\u306B\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\n\u975E\u73FE\u5B9F\u7684\u306A\u63D0\u6848\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While I\u0027d be delighted to receive your input on my syntheses, isn\u0027t that rather impractical?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u56DB\u516D\u6642\u4E2D\u79C1\u306E\u305D\u3070\u306B\u3044\u308B\u5FC5\u8981\u304C\n\u51FA\u3066\u304D\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027d need to be by my side constantly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u304A\u3044\u3066\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304C\u3001\n\u3000\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u7121\u7406\u304C\u3042\u308B\u304B\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Now that he mentions it, that would be impossible...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3054\u5FE0\u544A\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u3082\u4ECA\u5F8C\u3001\u9577\u304F\u7814\u7A76\u3092\u7D9A\u3051\u308B\u305F\u3081\u3001\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you for your advice. This is for continuing my research long-term, correct?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5206\u304B\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u306E\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You understand?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3002\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u306E\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3042\u308C\u3070\u3001\n\u9593\u9055\u3044\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. If it\u0027s coming from you, Sir Logy, it must be right."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306E\u4E2D\u306E\u898F\u5F8B\u3092\u3001\u3055\u3089\u306B\u6539\u3081\u308B\u3068\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I shall revise my internal discipline further."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u3002\u305D\u3046\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3068\u52A9\u304B\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. That would be helpful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u306E\u7814\u7A76\u529B\u306F\u78BA\u304B\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3060\u3002\n\u3000\u4F7F\u3046\u65B9\u5411\u3092\u9593\u9055\u3048\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u3001\n\u3000\u305D\u308C\u306F\u304D\u3063\u3068\u793E\u4F1A\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u306A\u308B\u306F\u305A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Walther\u0027s research ability is genuine. If directed properly, it could surely benefit society.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u4EBA\u306F\u5909\u308F\u308B\u3002\u7F6A\u3060\u3063\u3066\u511F\u3048\u308B\u3002\n\u3000\u4FFA\u304C\u898B\u3066\u304D\u305F\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u3092\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u3084\u308B\u3093\u3060\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(People can change. Even sins can be atoned for. I\u0027ll believe in the Walther I\u0027ve observed.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8272\u3005\u8A71\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u308A\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\n\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u6B8B\u5FF5\u306A\u304C\u3089\u3001\n\u5206\u304B\u308A\u5408\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you for talking with me at length. Though regrettably, it seems we cannot reach complete understanding."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306F\u305F\u3060\u3001\u77E5\u3092\u6C42\u3081\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3060\u3051\u3002\n\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC\u6BBF\u306E\u671F\u5F85\u306B\u5FDC\u3048\u308B\u306E\u306F\u96E3\u3057\u3044\u8A71\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I simply seek knowledge. Meeting your expectations might be difficult."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Walther"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u7D50\u5C40\u3001\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u3068\u5206\u304B\u308A\u5408\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306F\n\u3000\u3067\u304D\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(In the end, I couldn\u0027t reach an understanding with Walther.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9\u3055\u3093\u306E\u8A00\u3046\u3068\u304A\u308A\u3001\n\u3000\u3084\u306F\u308A\u30EF\u30EB\u30BF\u30FC\u306F\u5371\u967A\u4EBA\u7269\u306A\u306E\u304B\u2026\u2026\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Is Brad right? Is Walther truly dangerous after all...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7814\u7A76\u904E\u7A0B\u3067\u4EBA\u306F\u6BBA\u3081\u306A\u3044\u3001\u305D\u308C\u306F\n\u8CC7\u6599\u3092\u898B\u3066\u3001\u5B88\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306E\u306F\u5206\u304B\u308B\u304C\n\u751F\u307F\u51FA\u3057\u305F\u3082\u306E\u304C\u3001\u4F55\u3092\u3082\u305F\u3089\u3059\u306E\u304B\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He kept his word about not killing during research, that\u0027s clear from the records. But what his creations might lead to..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30B8\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Logy"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]